  "name": "Ghost world: Haunted Hollow (ground)",
  "notes": "The Ghost world's ground: the same 3x3-screen field (90x60 tiles) as every world. Only the 3-tile band around the edge is solid, so nobody can leave the map; inside, everything is walked over. No roads: the path pieces lie as clearings of bare ground, round, oval and rectangular, big and small, spread over the whole field (a round one where the player starts), with patches, beds of small things and the world's pictures in between and small things scattered on the plain ground. In the south-east, where the Alpha sleeps in every world, lies its den: a spirit circle of dark standing stones around a violet glow.",
